{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53391","headline":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还 · 鸿渐","name":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅居一海间，乡路祖州东。\n到国宣周礼，朝天得僧风。\n山冥鱼梵远，日正蜃楼空。\n人至非徐福，何由寄信通。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鸿渐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}